{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "LOCKED": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VERGRENDELD"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "UNLOCKED": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ONTGRENDELD"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bored Phone is active": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bored Phone is actief"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Full access": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Volledige toegang"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only your allowed apps are reachable.\nTap your NFC tag to unlock.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alleen je toegestane apps zijn bereikbaar.\nTik op je NFC-tag om te ontgrendelen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything is available.\nTap your NFC tag to lock in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alles is beschikbaar.\nTik op je NFC-tag om te vergrendelen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Locked by NFC": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vergrendeld via NFC"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strict Mode is active": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Strikte modus is actief"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deleting this app and changing accounts or the date/time are blocked until you unlock. Settings → Screen Time can still revoke this — Apple guarantees that path always stays open, for any app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deze app verwijderen en accounts of datum/tijd wijzigen zijn geblokkeerd tot je ontgrendelt. Instellingen → Schermtijd kan dit nog steeds intrekken — Apple garandeert dat dat pad altijd open blijft, voor elke app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no button in this app to unlock it. Tap your tag.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Er zit geen knop in deze app om te ontgrendelen. Tik op je tag."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I lost my NFC tag": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik ben mijn NFC-tag kwijt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allowed apps": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toegestane apps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "(entire category)": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "(hele categorie)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These stay reachable once you lock with your tag. Phone, Messages and Settings are always reachable — iOS never lets them be blocked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deze blijven bereikbaar zodra je vergrendelt met je tag. Telefoon, Berichten en Instellingen zijn altijd bereikbaar — iOS laat nooit toe dat die geblokkeerd worden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose allowed apps": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kies toegestane apps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before you lock: include these two": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voordat je vergrendelt: voeg deze twee toe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bored Phone and Shortcuts must both be in your allowed apps, or they'll shield themselves too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bored Phone en Opdrachten moeten beide bij je toegestane apps staan, anders blokkeren ze zichzelf ook."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One permission needed": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eén toestemming nodig"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS will now ask to let Bored Phone use Screen Time. Choose the option that says Continue or Allow — that's what lets the app shield anything at all. Don't worry if you tap the wrong one by mistake, you can try again below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS vraagt zo of Bored Phone Schermtijd mag gebruiken. Kies de optie met Doorgaan of Toestaan — dat is wat de app in staat stelt om iets te blokkeren. Per ongeluk de verkeerde getikt? Geen probleem, probeer het hieronder gewoon opnieuw."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doorgaan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try again": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opnieuw proberen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for your response…": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wachten op je reactie…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tip: tap individual apps rather than \"Select All\" then deselecting — that keeps the list small on purpose. The picker also shows apps and sites Apple knows about generally, not just ones installed on this phone; ones you don't recognize are harmless to ignore.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tip: tik losse apps aan in plaats van \"Selecteer alles\" en dan weer uitvinken — zo blijft de lijst expres klein. De kiezer toont ook apps en sites die Apple kent in het algemeen, niet alleen wat op deze telefoon staat; onbekende items kun je gewoon negeren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the tag works": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hoe de tag werkt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose your allowed apps above, and include Bored Phone + Shortcuts so they don't lock themselves out.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kies hierboven je toegestane apps, en voeg Bored Phone + Opdrachten toe zodat ze zichzelf niet buitensluiten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Shortcuts → Automation → NFC, scan your tag, then tap “Create New Shortcut” — not an app suggestion, or you won't be able to add a second action. Set “Run Immediately”, and add two actions: “Toggle Bored Phone”, then “Set Focus” → pick the Focus you just made and set it to “Toggle”, not “Turn On”, so the same tap works both ways. Opened Bored Phone at least once already? “Toggle Bored Phone” should show up when you search “Bored”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ga in Opdrachten → Automatisering → NFC, scan je tag, en tik dan op “Maak nieuwe opdracht aan” — niet op een appsuggestie, anders kun je geen tweede actie meer toevoegen. Kies “Direct uitvoeren” en voeg twee acties toe: “Bored Phone aan/uit”, en daarna “Stel Focus in” → kies de Focus die je net hebt gemaakt en zet die op “Wissel”, niet op “Zet aan”, zodat dezelfde tik beide kanten op werkt. Heb je Bored Phone al minstens één keer geopend? Dan zou “Bored Phone aan/uit” verschijnen als je zoekt op “Bored”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Build a minimal home screen page with just your allowed apps, then make a matching Focus.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maak een minimale beginschermpagina met alleen je toegestane apps, en maak dan een bijpassende Focus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How to set this up": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hoe je dit instelt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Long-press your home screen → swipe to a new empty page → add only your allowed apps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Houd je beginscherm ingedrukt → swipe naar een nieuwe lege pagina → voeg alleen je toegestane apps toe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings → Focus → + → Custom → name it “Boring”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instellingen → Focus → + → Aangepast → noem hem “Boring”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Under People and Apps, allow the contacts and notifications you actually need.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sta bij Personen en Apps de contacten en meldingen toe die je echt nodig hebt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Under Customize Screens → Home Screen, enable page filtering and tick only your new page.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zet bij Schermen aanpassen → Beginscherm het filteren van pagina's aan en vink alleen je nieuwe pagina aan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That tag is now the only key.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die tag is nu de enige sleutel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Shortcuts": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Opdrachten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Instellingen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sluiten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Have you really checked?": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Heb je echt gezocht?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pockets. Bag. Desk. The place you usually leave it. Most \"lost\" tags are five meters away.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zakken. Tas. Bureau. De plek waar je hem meestal laat liggen. De meeste \"kwijtgeraakte\" tags liggen vijf meter verderop."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I checked, still can't find it": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik heb gezocht, kan hem niet vinden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let me go check again": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik ga nog even zoeken"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Be honest with yourself": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wees eerlijk tegen jezelf"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This exists for real emergencies — not for when five more minutes of scrolling feels urgent. Continuing starts a 24-hour wait before you can unlock this way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dit is bedoeld voor echte noodgevallen — niet voor wanneer nog vijf minuten scrollen dringend voelt. Doorgaan start een wachttijd van 24 uur voordat je op deze manier kunt ontgrendelen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start the 24-hour wait": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start de wachttijd van 24 uur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Actually, I'll wait for the tag": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik wacht toch liever op de tag"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting it out": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uitzitten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If it's genuinely urgent, this is the price — a real 24 hours, not app-open time. It keeps counting even if you close Bored Phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Als het echt dringend is, is dit de prijs — een echte 24 uur, geen tijd dat de app open moet staan. De klok blijft lopen ook als je Bored Phone sluit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel this request": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Annuleer dit verzoek"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The wait is over": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De wachttijd is voorbij"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock Bored Phone now": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ontgrendel Bored Phone nu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prefer to do it manually, or want to remove Bored Phone entirely? Settings → Screen Time → Bored Phone → Stop Using Screen Time works too, and always has — Apple guarantees that path stays open for an app you install yourself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Liever handmatig, of wil je Bored Phone helemaal verwijderen? Instellingen → Schermtijd → Bored Phone → Schermtijd niet meer gebruiken werkt ook, en werkte altijd al — Apple garandeert dat dit pad open blijft voor een app die je zelf installeert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Toggle Bored Phone": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bored Phone aan/uit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turns Bored Phone on if it is off, and off if it is on. Attach this to an NFC tag automation in Shortcuts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zet Bored Phone aan als hij uit staat, en uit als hij aan staat. Koppel dit aan een NFC-tag-automatisering in Opdrachten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bored Phone on. See you on the other side.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bored Phone aan. Tot op de andere kant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bored Phone off. Welcome back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bored Phone uit. Welkom terug."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lock Bored Phone": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bored Phone vergrendelen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turns Bored Phone on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zet Bored Phone aan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bored Phone on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bored Phone aan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock Bored Phone": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bored Phone ontgrendelen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turns Bored Phone off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zet Bored Phone uit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bored Phone off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bored Phone uit."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
